   "source": [
    "# 1. Package architecture"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0b8d83a7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "| Package | Role |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `langchain` | streamlined high-level APIs |\n",
    "| `langchain-core` | core abstractions and LCEL |\n",
    "| `langchain-community` | community integrations |\n",
    "| provider packages | OpenAI/Anthropic/Google/AWS/etc. integrations |\n",
    "| `langgraph` | graph runtime/orchestration |\n",
    "| `deepagents` | long-running agent harness |\n",
    "| `langsmith` | tracing/evals/testing/deployment tooling |\n",
    "\n",
    "**v1 change:** main `langchain` namespace was deliberately reduced. This made it look agent-centric, but retrieval/data components remain active across `langchain-core` and integration packages."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "154af55b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 2. Installation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "969176aa",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```bash\n",
    "%pip install -U langchain langchain-core langchain-community \n",
    "%pip install -U langgraph  \n",
    "%pip install -U deepagents\n",
    "```\n",
    "Typical provider installs:\n",
    "\n",
    "```bash\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-openai\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-anthropic\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-google-genai\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-aws\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-huggingface\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-ollama\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-mcp-adapters\n",
    "pip install -U langchain-text-splitters\n",
    "```"
   ]
