   "source": [
    "```\n",
    "invoke() → Use when you have one input and want one complete output; best for normal single-user requests like “summarize this text.”\n",
    "batch() → Use when you have many independent inputs and want to process them together efficiently; best for cases like “summarize 100 documents/questions.”\n",
    "stream() → Use when you want to receive the response progressively as it is generated instead of waiting for the full answer; best for chat UIs where users should see tokens/results immediately.\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
